"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "At the Beach", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you go to the beach, you wear a different type of clothing. This type of clothing is called <span class=\"italic\">swimwear</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">beachwear</span>. Remember that when you are referring to clothing or beach items, you use nouns.<br> Swimwear is the clothing you wear when in the water.<br>Beachwear is the clothing you wear at the beach, not in the water. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Men</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Women</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Swimwear</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">swimsuit <br>shorts/trunks</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">swimsuit *<br>bikini<br>tankini</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Beachwear</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">shorts<br>t-shirts<br>tank tops<br>flip flops<br>sunglasses</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">shorts<br>dresses<br>cover-ups<br>t-shirts<br>tank tops<br>flip flops<br>sunglasses</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "* Another name for <span class=\"italic\">swimsuit</span> is <span class=\"italic\">bathing suit</span>. The name you use depends on where you live in the world.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "swimsuit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of clothing you wear for swimming ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I packed my swimsuit in my bag.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when packing for the beach.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bikini", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of clothing in two separate parts that women wear for swimming", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to wear a bikini in the summer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "one-piece", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clothing that consists of only one part; not separate parts ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am taking a one-piece swimsuit. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "towel ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of cloth that you use for drying your skin ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Remember to take your beach towel. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cover-up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of clothing women put over their  swimsuit ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't have a cover-up for the beach. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sunscreen", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a cream that you rub into your skin to stop the sun from burning you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Remember to wear sunscreen at the beach.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sunglasses ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "dark glasses that you wear to protect your eyes from the sun  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Did you pack your sunglasses? It's very sunny in Mexico.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "beach bag", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a bag you put your things in when you go to the beach", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This looks like a nice beach bag.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to tan", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make your skin darker by spending time in the sun", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to tan at the beach.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet or look in a magazine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find images of swimwear and beachwear you like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Cut them out or print them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Label the images.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your outfits with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify different swimwear and beachwear.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about outfits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my outfit with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": t